From 3392bf7c22a8f7e8dca2cdaf8b2b47ddc56009ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: f0ck0 <141256669+f0ck0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 07:41:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(cart,checkout,home,pdp): restore PDP Buy Now/Add-to-Cart,
 variant price-mirror bug, cart consent gate, review marquees
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Bug fixes:
- cart.ts: scope [data-qty]/[data-remove] delegation to [data-cart-lines] — PDP add/buy triggers carry data-qty, so clicks were swallowed by the qty branch and did nothing (root cause of dead PDP buttons).
- pdp.ts: writePrice() no longer sweeps bare [data-price] nodes (that overwritten trigger button labels with the amount after variant switches); sticky-bar slot now uses the data-variant-price contract.
- dom.ts: toggleHidden syncs the real hidden attribute.
- checkout.ts + scripts/lib/buy-now.ts: no-JS Buy Now deep link (?buy=…) boots a detached one-line checkout, stored bag/remote cart untouched.
- cart page: restore checkout + continue-shopping + terms consent checkbox with inline hint (en/zh-Hant/ja), without removing existing info.

Homepage: twin review marquees after New Arrivals (top row L→R, bottom R→L), real Medusa data only — global feed with per-product fan-out; hidden when empty. Shared review lib (src/lib/reviews.ts) consumed by api/reviews.

Tests: 5 jsdom/contract suites added — 87 passing locally; astro check at 0 errors; build clean.

Co-authored-by: Arena Agent Mode <agent@arena.ai>

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
